LeetCode #1208 — Get Equal Substrings Within Budget

Exact filename: GetEqualSubstringsWithinBudget.java

Algorithm

Use a sliding window.

Start left = 0.
Move right through both strings.
Calculate the cost of changing s[right] into t[right].
Add the cost to the current window.
If total cost exceeds maxCost, move left forward and remove its cost.
Record the largest valid window.

This gives O(n) time and O(1) extra space.
